            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku eiguane olaiguanani, neitobir ilasho oare le sahabu. Nejoki olorere, “Ishomo intae Yerusalem enkata naado. Eng'ura nkaitin inyi intae Israel, naa ninche apa naaitayutuo intae te nkop e Misiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitasheyie ninye nabo te Betel nepik enkae Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ina bae eng'oki, amu eshomo iltung'ana aayiaya nabo te Betel, nepuo aayiaya enkae te Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitobira sii apa nkajijik too wuejitin e shumata, negelu ilapolosak tiatua olorere pooki, leme iloo Lawi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
