            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Negelu Yeroboam osirua te nkolong e tomon o imiet o lapa le isiet, anaa apa osirua oatae te Yuda, neitayu ninye ilasarri te nchumata olperere lo lasar; neaku etaasa ninye ina te Betel, apolosaki lelo asho ooitobira. Nepik ilapolosak Betel too wuejitin e shumata neeitobira ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neilep ninye alo ilo perere lo lasar oitobira te Betel te nkolong e tomon o imiet, to lapa le isiet, teilo apa otegelua ninye to ltau lenye makewan; neitisiny ilo sirua tenkaraki iltung'ana loo Siraeli, neilep alo olperere lo lasar apej enkorropil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.33"
            ]
          }
        }
